      "element_ref": {
        "component_id": "release-package",
        "element_id": "managed-update-and-quality-handoff"
      },
      "material": true,
      "rationale": "The current policy, caller, receipt schema, updater, emitter, and focused pre-acceptance lifecycle tests bind the local update and content-free receipt behavior. The SKILL documents the external consumer handoff, but this repository does not execute or verify destination derivation, contribution preview, or public-consent enforcement; exact owner acceptance authorizes none of those external states.",
      "statement": "The local package defines and tests a consent-gated managed-update check plus one content-free owner-bound quality receipt after substantive use, documents an external owner-bound recommended-update handoff, and carries one closed policy plus one thin full-SHA-pinned managed-repair caller without default outbound transport.",
      "status": "supported"
    },
