      "material": true,
      "rationale": "The current SKILL and three complete references contain the declared relations, and the persisted 15-test contract suite passed anchors for full-contract reruns after repair, a three-cycle nonconvergence boundary, absolute endpoints, declared subtraction order, same-row matching, target-batch exclusion, and hidden-precision auditability.",
